      "competition_and_coherence": "Target is not universally superior: ZrTc2 and several ternary children have larger source responses; Lu increases lambda but lowers Tc. Tc radioactivity limits practical follow-up, not this computation. Scalar NC treatment and C14 competitor are explicit. Zero SCF forces and positive sampled phonon evidence support a near-zero-pressure local source minimum, not bulk ground-state synthesis. Saved q2 all12 representations converge, all18 nonzero-q frequencies positive, and ten Ry Gaussian widths contain all18 lambda/gamma modes. No native exit inferred. C14 competition, SOC, radioactivity and metaphase retention remain bounded risks.",
